		{"id":"node1formula12345","type":"text","text":"## 投影公式\n$$x = \\frac{fX}{Z}$$\n$$y = \\frac{fY}{Z}$$\n除以 Z 产生透视","x":-500,"y":310,"width":200,"height":100},
		{"id":"node1intrinsic12","type":"text","text":"## 内参矩阵 K\n$$\\begin{bmatrix} f_x & \\gamma & c_x \\\\ 0 & f_y & c_y \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}$$\n- $f_x, f_y$: 焦距\n- $c_x, c_y$: 主点\n- $\\gamma$: 斜切","x":-500,"y":460,"width":200,"height":120},
		{"id":"node1extrinsic12","type":"text","text":"## 外参 [R|T]\n- R: 旋转矩阵\n- T: 平移向量\n描述相机位置方向","x":-500,"y":630,"width":200,"height":80},
		{"id":"node1projection1","type":"text","text":"## ⭐ 核心投影\n$$\\mathbf{x} = K[R|T]\\mathbf{X}$$\n世界→相机→图像","x":-500,"y":760,"width":200,"height":100},
		{"id":"node1real1234567","type":"text","text":"## 真实相机问题\n- 光圈 Aperture\n- 快门 Shutter\n- 对焦 Focus\n- 畸变 Distortion","x":-500,"y":910,"width":200,"height":100},
